  {
   "id": "concept2",
   "type": "concept",
   "title": {
    "en": "Steps in the balance method"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "Balance every ledger account, including cash and bank. Write each account with its balance in the debit or the credit column. Add both columns. If they agree, the ledger is arithmetically correct; if not, look for errors."
   },
   "points": [
    {
     "en": "Balance all accounts"
    },
    {
     "en": "Place each balance in the right column"
    },
    {
     "en": "Total and compare"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "Balance every ledger account, including cash and bank. Write each account with its balance in the debit or the credit column. Add both columns. If they agree, the ledger is arithmetically correct; if not, look for errors.",
    "kn": "ಪ್ರತಿ ಖಾತೆಯನ್ನು ಬಾಕಿ ತೆಗೆಯಿರಿ. ಪ್ರತಿ ಬಾಕಿಯನ್ನು ಡೆಬಿಟ್ ಅಥವಾ ಕ್ರೆಡಿಟ್ ಕಾಲಂನಲ್ಲಿ ಬರೆಯಿರಿ. ಎರಡು ಕಾಲಂಗಳನ್ನು ಕೂಡಿಸಿ. ತಾಳೆಯಾಗದಿದ್ದರೆ ತಪ್ಪುಗಳನ್ನು ಹುಡುಕಿ."
   }
